@*
    The layout for the screens that exist before there is anybody to show a sidebar to.

    No navigation, because nothing behind it is reachable yet; the shell's chrome would be five
    links to five refusals.
*@
@inherits LayoutComponentBase
@* The sign-in page is static, so only the theme provider is mounted here, never the popover, dialog or snackbar
   providers, which are interactive-only (study §2.3). *@
<AlvoTheme />

<div class="a-bare-shell">
    <div class="a-content">
        @Body
    </div>
</div>
